{
  "about": "Art library (21 sets: 20 made for it plus fall-06, the Castle art first used for Fall 2026) for future Catalyst editions. Each set = a textless cover drawing (pen-and-ink + watercolor, 3584:4800) plus a matching wide hero photo (~2.36:1) and a tall phone hero (800:1434). Pick an available set whose season matches the new edition, then set its status to \"used\" and used_by to the edition. See README.md.",
